From 7026728155f5f2e840894ee2fb1e37e80aaa7b09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeremy Bicha <jbicha@debian.org>
Date: Wed, 23 Feb 2022 08:06:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Restore backspace for going to parent folder

This restores the behaviour from nautilus <= 3.4.
---
